  "description": "A lightweight extension for System.Xml.Linq that adds runtime object binding, hierarchical modeling, and flexible path resolution via enriched XAttribute support. Includes enum-based metadata, tree construction from flat paths, and event-driven behaviors — ideal for dynamic UIs, workflows, and cross-platform .NET apps. (Ever wish XAttribute had a Tag property? Now it does.)",
